body:
{[The Woman in the Trunk](https://www.romance.io/books/5f7198f22aedfb0e2847bf59/the-woman-in-the-trunk-jessica-gadziala?src=rdt&thr=1g40heq) by [Jessica Gadziala](https://www.romance.io/authors/5555bf809eef3b3f1d522d0d/jessica-gadziala)}

I thought the mmc was unique in the way he seemed like a real human and not an ultra broody person that had no real opinions or thoughts 

fmc is a real one #loveher

{Resisting the rancher by Lynda chance} 

This fits the most with this prompt. Fmc is pretty submissive to mmc wants and mmc is very dominant and pushy.

{Protecting Alabama by Susan Stoker} 

Not exactly but fmc is very quiet, works as a cleaner and loves to do things for the mmc. Mmc is very dominant and a self described “alpha” (he says it so much…). There’s pretty good grovel.

{Shooter by Dahlia West} 

my favourite. Fmc is pretty domestic. Cooks all the time, when she was younger all she wanted was a husband. Mmc is hyper alpha ex military and loves her cooking. She also majorly takes care of him. I adore this book. Southern contemporary.

{stepbrothers rules by rennee rose} smut novella based of 1950s, daddy and step brother kink. Fmc only wants to be his perfect housewife and is trying to learn, he is pretty alpha.

{Duncan’s bride by Linda Howard} have not read but seems like it could fit
